      "message": "16gb preset: the pool figure came from a 16K run, not the 32K it ships\n\n59,753 tokens / 64.5 tok/s were measured with --max-model-len 16384. The preset sets\n32768, and no measurement exists at that length with these other settings, so the\ncomment was attributing a number to a configuration that was never run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
